  <item>
    <title>5.METOO特辑3｜未来，慢慢来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c9f7ac6bcfd941026c1289</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63c9f7ac6bcfd941026c1289</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Jan 2023 02:08:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>首次面对面聊天，</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你将听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnTOkvg43nuWDVq0dHCWVH9lg2Y4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>工作这件事特别霸道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>上班 / 学生 身份的转变</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>没有人是能够被安排的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>做自己的开山人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>关于选择</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">09:17</a> </span><strong><span>Summer：</span></strong><span>关于我做决定的“值域”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> </span><strong><span>白：</span></strong><span>不做“选择题”，就让车子顺理成章的拐到人生的一个“弯”里</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>别说“试一试”问你的心 ：你想做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>从学生到社会 第一个阶段是你和你的家庭之间有一个看不见的界限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>其实身份的转变只是一个表象</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>身上的责任</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“慢慢来”“别着急”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>别从第三视角 “审视”自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>螺旋状上升的生活状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>年龄的焦虑 当然NO!</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Song List：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Lovely city - Mokita</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Conversation - The Silent League</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>象牙舟 - &nbsp;傻子与白痴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我是一只鱼 - Kim.T</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Host：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Summer / 小白</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo1bQSC7vq9GK7MgeOtgifx3cNoG.m4a" length="47054113" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:29</itunes:duration>
