  <item>
    <title>4.METOO特辑2｜享受时间在我身上慢慢浪费</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63981b28a700c6829b940095</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63981b28a700c6829b940095</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Dec 2022 06:26:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这个话题下，「我也是」有点变味儿了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnTOkvg43nuWDVq0dHCWVH9lg2Y4.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>在第二集的节目里你将听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 你可以一个人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> &nbsp;独处却不孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在独处时喜欢做的事</span></p><span></span><p><span>——「与空间发生主观联系」</span></p><span></span><p><span>——「与每一件物品产生联系」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> &nbsp;我与我「非人的伴侣」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> &nbsp;独处的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> &nbsp;我们还不</span><strong><span>认识</span></strong><span>孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a> 「生未百年 死不孤独」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> &nbsp;以追悼为名的老友聚会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1869">31:09</a> &nbsp;面对「过去」的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> &nbsp;身体/大脑的独处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 「自己和自己玩」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> &nbsp;享受时间浪费的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> &nbsp;工作和生活的平衡感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3033">50:33</a> &nbsp;普鲁斯特问卷：如果有来生，你想变成什么？</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>Song List🎧：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>Ordinary People &nbsp;- Blake Rose</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>冬天时我喜欢靠近温暖的事 - 宿羽阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Lucile - 丁可</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>The end of the world - &nbsp;Skeeter Davis</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>Host： Summer &amp; 白宇晨</span></strong></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lme41pf2SRzCebUj2-2jZFfIrj8j.m4a" length="52171091" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:45</itunes:duration>
